1
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,720
It was a perfectly good review meeting.

2
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,200
If you'd been a bit humble,

3
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,840
you could've gotten by easily.

4
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,880
But you,

5
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,600
turned it into your own personal stage.

6
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,560
You practically ruined your career.

7
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:45,840
You probably don't know this.

8
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,600
Right after you

9
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,160
put on that little show,

10
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,960
Chief Liu immediately

11
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,000
took the matter straight to

12
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,920
higher command and the academy committee.

13
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,560
Have the disciplinary results arrived?

14
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,720
They have.

15
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,000
Guo Zijian,

16
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,360
you probably had no idea.

17
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,720
Given your

18
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,000
overall capabilities,

19
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,080
originally,

20
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,760
a deputy regimental position

21
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:20,840
was lined up for you as acting commander.

22
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,280
They were going to announce it

23
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,120
right after the exercise ended.

24
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,440
Now look what you've done.

25
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,240
It's dead on arrival.

26
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,240
Furthermore,

27
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,280
there are two more disciplinary decisions.

28
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,440
Listen up.

29
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,720
First,

30
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,880
the academy is revoking

31
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,880
all your key development plans.

32
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,840
Your original assignments to the

33
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,040
Air Assault and 4th Special Ops Brigade,

34
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,440
along with your research projects,

35
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:49,360
are completely halted.

36
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:51,000
Second,

37
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,440
you're being transferred from the academy

38
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:53,680
for another assignment.

39
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,960
Does that mean going back to my old unit?

40
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,080
Keep dreaming.

41
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,480
Where am I going, then?

42
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,600
Just tell me straight.

43
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,000
To the 396th Brigade's 1st Battalion

44
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:05,440
as Acting Battalion Commander.

45
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,000
What do they mean?

46
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,240
Transferring Guo Zijian

47
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,160
to be the commander of 1st Battalion?

48
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,760
Isn't that planting a time bomb

49
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:30,800
in our 396th Brigade?

50
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,520
In less than two days,

51
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,880
this was settled in such a way.

52
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,520
There must be

53
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:42,040
a deeper underlying reason.

54
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,800
No, you can punish him,

55
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,760
but don't disgust us.

56
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,680
This is a joint decision made by

57
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,000
the Group Army and Infantry Academy.

58
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,880
It must be executed.

59
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,520
Therefore,

60
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,800
for us,

61
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:57,680
first,

62
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,600
obey orders.

63
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,280
Second,

64
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,400
ensure implementation.

65
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,360
Only third is

66
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,240
straightening out our thoughts

67
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,000
and calming our emotions.

68
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Political Commissar, I'm telling you,

69
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,400
we've all seen his lousy attitude.

70
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,960
You tell me, with a guy like him coming,

71
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,920
how could we not be upset?

72
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:11,720
Old Suo,

73
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,480
as the Acting Brigade Commander,

74
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,080
you must bear it even if you're upset.

75
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,720
Good Lord.

76
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,800
This is the military,

77
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,680
not a free market out there.

78
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:20,800
Besides,

79
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,400
once this matter is announced,

80
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,760
all the troops in the Eighth Group Army

81
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,040
will be watching us.

82
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,640
If we brigade leaders

83
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,720
don't even have this much tolerance,

84
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,400
how can we lead troops in the future?

85
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,800
Then what prestige

86
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,280
will the 396th Brigade have

87
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,840
in the Eighth Group Army?

88
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,960
Don't lecture me, Political Commissar.

89
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,120
I know.

90
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,800
Even if I'm not upset,

91
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,480
what about the troops in the exercise?

92
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,440
I'll say this right here:

93
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,600
when this kid comes,

94
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,760
he'll definitely leave messes behind,

95
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:52,960
and we'll be cleaning up after him all day.

96
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,680
Old Suo, Old Suo.

97
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,440
Why does it sound to me

98
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:00,280
like you

99
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:02,880
lack confidence in managing your men?

100
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,400
Those words

101
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,200
don't sound like the Suo Jian'an I know.

102
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,000
I'll say it again.

103
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,760
At any time,

104
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,840
and under any circumstances,

105
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,040
we must be fair and objective

106
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,720
in understanding and employing our cadres.

107
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,920
The transfer order is down.

108
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,600
Obey orders.

109
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,080
No, Old Kang.

110
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,080
Let's get on the same page,

111
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,840
and reach a mutual understanding.

112
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,200
This kid

113
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,680
is full of flaws.

114
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,440
I want to set him straight.

115
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,280
Let's the two of us

116
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,880
really sort him out.

117
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,200
As long as you keep your emotions in check,

118
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,600
I will fully support your work.

119
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:56,800
All right.

120
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:58,840
Sort him out.

121
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,200
Brother.

122
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,800
Grandma said you got transferred to be a battalion commander.

123
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,520
Congratulations.

124
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,880
Grandma sure talks fast.

125
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,680
You becoming a battalion commander is a big deal for our family.

126
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,480
Of course she'd let everyone know.

127
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,160
Alright, get to the point.

128
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:33,240
I heard it's really tough down in frontline units.

129
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,280
I'm just worried about you.

130
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,000
Here, give it to me.

131
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
Honestly,

132
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,680
stop talking nonsense.

133
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,280
I...

134
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,960
Why would a soldier be afraid of hardship?

135
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,440
Zijian,

136
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:44,680
When Grandpa and I heard you became

137
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,960
a battalion commander, we were thrilled.

138
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,960
Only by training at the grassroots level

139
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,880
can you become a good soldier.

140
00:06:58,280 --> 00:06:59,200
See?

141
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,320
It's not like you don't know

142
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,680
he doesn't want to listen to you.

143
00:07:01,880 --> 00:07:02,800
Just hang up.

144
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,440
Even in my wildest dreams,

145
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,520
I wouldn't have dared to imagine this.

146
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,680
My replacement as 1st Battalion Commander

147
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,000
is actually Guo Zijian.

148
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:25,080
That backstab of yours was pretty ruthless.

149
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,200
You reported him to the academy committee.

150
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,160
This is what I call

151
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,080
a taste of his own medicine.

152
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,520
He thinks he's so capable, right?

153
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:33,560
This time,

154
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,440
I'm going to show him exactly

155
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,440
whether our 396th Brigade

156
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,560
is a sleeping cat

157
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,440
or a fierce tiger.

158
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,120
Guo Zijian's biggest flaw

159
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,200
is that he loves to show off.

160
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:42,920
Just watch.

161
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,440
Once he gets to the 396th Brigade,

162
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,400
he won't be able to sit still.

163
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,040
I know exactly how to deal with his kind.

164
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,440
We need to give him a show of force

165
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,680
to put him in his place.

166
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,560
Got an idea?

167
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,240
You'll find out soon enough.

168
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,040
Comrades,

169
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,120
Previously, as a training staff officer,

170
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,960
Comrade Guo Zijian represented the academy

171
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,920
in joint training exercises with us.

172
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,080
Everyone

173
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,760
is already familiar with him.

174
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,360
But from now on,

175
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,920
his role

176
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,560
will be completely different.

177
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,240
If he was a guest before,

178
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,840
then starting today,

179
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:21,920
he is a part of our 396th Brigade.

180
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,600
Furthermore, he is

181
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,760
the main leader of our Red 1st Battalion.

182
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,320
Comrade Sang Haitian!

183
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,200
Here!

184
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,400
As

185
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,440
a senior comrade

186
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,520
and a veteran political worker,

187
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,640
I hope you two can work closely together

188
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,039
to lead the 1st Battalion

189
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,360
to new heights.

190
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,120
Yes, sir!

191
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:43,919
Battalion Commander Guo,

192
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,080
on behalf of all 1st Battalion troops,

193
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,800
I extend a warm welcome to you.

194
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,080
Furthermore, I hope that in the days to come,

195
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,640
we can stand together through thick and thin.

196
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,640
Well,

197
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,600
normally,

198
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:14,040
the appointment of a battalion-level cadre

199
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,960
would just be handled by the office.

200
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:18,320
But since

201
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,600
Dean Chen is here,

202
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,480
the standard is different now.

203
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:23,240
Dean,

204
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,200
please give us some instructions.

205
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,440
I wouldn't dare give instructions.

206
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:31,440
Offering a humble apology is more like it.

207
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:34,400
Comrades,

208
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,160
Comrade Guo's appointment to 1st Battalion

209
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,600
is something our academy

210
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,600
and the leaders of the Eighth Group Army

211
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:41,800
decided together.

212
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,880
I have no right to make arbitrary comments.

213
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:48,640
I came to this handover meeting today

214
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,000
because the academy committee entrusted me

215
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,600
to specifically offer our

216
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,600
comrades in the 396th Brigade

217
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,360
an apology.

218
00:09:59,320 --> 00:09:59,880
Dean Chen,

219
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:02,000
you're too polite. Please sit.

220
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,480
Yes.

221
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:04,440
Sit down.

222
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:06,080
Comrade Guo Zijian

223
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,680
is the Acting Battalion Commander of the Red 1st Battalion.

224
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,000
This word "acting"

225
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,480
is very interesting in itself.

226
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:13,400
First,

227
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,840
he lacks experience as a commander,

228
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:17,840
and needs tempering.

229
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,160
Second,

230
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:22,240
he must pay for his past words and actions

231
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,320
and take responsibility.

232
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,400
Third,

233
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,600
I hope he himself

234
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,200
can, in this position,

235
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,080
achieve results,

236
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,760
and not let down the academy leaders

237
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,960
and the army commanders' expectations.

238
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:33,800
Fourth,

239
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,320
Time to see

240
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,840
what he's made of.

241
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,480
He must come to our frontline units,

242
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,560
because the proof is in the pudding.

243
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,080
True capability

244
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,760
doesn't come from

245
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,560
just talking a good game.

246
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,080
Whether he can drop the 'acting' title,

247
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,120
or even be accepted by our 1st Battalion

248
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,560
and the 396th Brigade,

249
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,360
all of this

250
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,480
will depend on his own performance

251
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,400
and abilities.

252
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,000
Guo Zijian!

253
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,080
Here!

254
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,040
Why don't you say a few words?

255
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:02,440
Commanders,

256
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,440
I won't make any statements.

257
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,160
Leaders,

258
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:08,520
I'll let my actions speak for themselves.

259
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,640
Just watch my performance.

260
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:14,560
All right.

261
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,560
That concludes the handover meeting.

262
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:18,160
Sir.

263
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,120
Sit down.

264
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:19,880
Yes, sir.

265
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,840
Staff Officer Guo just said...

266
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:24,520
Wait, no.

267
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,080
It's Battalion Commander Guo now.

268
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,440
You said you'd use practical actions

269
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,600
to show your stance for the future, right?

270
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:31,320
That's right.

271
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,600
Good.

272
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,080
Let me report to the commanders.

273
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:38,080
Due to the exercise over the past two days,

274
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:40,000
we've exposed a lot of problems.

275
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,320
Furthermore,

276
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,760
with Battalion Commander Guo's reminder...

277
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,120
As the Operations and Training Chief,

278
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,560
over the past two days,

279
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,480
I've also reflected deeply on it.

280
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,360
With the approval of the brigade commanders

281
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:53,120
and Group Army's Ops and Training Branch,

282
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:54,800
we have decided

283
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,600
that the exercise participants,

284
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,400
all 1st and 2nd Battalion troops,

285
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,520
will remain at the Instructional Unit

286
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:00,920
to undergo another

287
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,760
Combat After-Action Review Exercise.

288
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:05,200
Yes, sir.

289
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,440
That is indeed how we arranged it.

290
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:09,360
However,

291
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:10,880
given the current

292
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,840
vacancy for the 1st Battalion Commander,

293
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:15,440
we originally planned to arrange

294
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,960
for a battalion commander from the 3rd or 4th Battalion

295
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,320
to lead the 1st Battalion

296
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,360
in organizing the confrontation.

297
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:21,960
But now,

298
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,480
Battalion Commander Guo has dropped from the sky,

299
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:24,760
which perfectly

300
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,360
solves our problem.

301
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:29,720
Chief Liu,

302
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,160
what do you mean?

303
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:34,240
Are you suggesting we have Guo Zijian

304
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,040
lead 1st Battalion in the exercise now?

305
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:38,280
Not exactly right now.

306
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:41,240
The normal plan is to start tomorrow night.

307
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:42,760
As for how it will be organized specifically,

308
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,120
it just so happens that

309
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,960
Staff Officer Liang from Exercise Control

310
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,720
hasn't left yet.

311
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,880
So we asked her and the new comrades

312
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,840
to participate in the control.

313
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,480
Of course, Battalion Commander Guo,

314
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,360
if you choose to give up exercising

315
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,840
the authority of 1st Battalion Commander,

316
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,960
that's fine too.

317
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,840
We can arrange an

318
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,600
observer seat for you.

319
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,920
Battalion Commander Guo, it's up to you.

320
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,120
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

321
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,960
what is it? Go ahead.

322
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:09,480
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

323
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,160
Guo Zijian just arrived at 1st Battalion.

324
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:12,240
He doesn't know anyone,

325
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,160
and knows nothing about the battalion.

326
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,720
Having him take command at a time like this...

327
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,680
I think we should wait until next time.

328
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:17,400
Chief Liu,

329
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,160
I accept this task.

330
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,480
Battalion Commander Guo,

331
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:28,440
maybe

332
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,800
you should reconsider.

333
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:31,640
To be honest,

334
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,120
we've prepared several backup plans.

335
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,240
It doesn't have to be you.

336
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:36,480
Don't force yourself.

337
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,320
No need.

338
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,520
From the operation a few days ago,

339
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,720
I've learned enough about 1st Battalion.

340
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:42,960
That's for the best, then.

341
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,560
As for the specific exercise plan,

342
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:46,680
we will just follow

343
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,960
Exercise Control's arrangements later.

344
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,320
All right.

345
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:51,960
There's no time like the present.

346
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:53,600
Dean Chen,

347
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,080
since our cadets haven't left yet,

348
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:57,720
staying another couple of days won't hurt.

349
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,360
Guo Zijian will personally command this time.

350
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:01,800
You and the cadets

351
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,880
should stay and observe together.

352
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,800
Here's the thing, Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

353
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:10,240
The cadets must return for graduation.

354
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:12,400
However, I can stay behind

355
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,320
to record the entire process

356
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,720
of this confrontation exercise.

357
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,200
I also want to witness firsthand

358
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:22,240
if our academy comrades

359
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,720
are truly suited for practical training.

360
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,320
Guo Zijian.

361
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:28,960
Here!

362
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:30,720
Since you've accepted the challenge,

363
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:32,480
go all out and fight well.

364
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:33,400
Understood?

365
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,360
Yes, sir.

366
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,880
I believe everyone knows me.

367
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,160
I won't introduce myself.

368
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:43,680
Because of the exercise a few days ago,

369
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,040
I believe many of you don't like me.

370
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,040
Or even hate me.

371
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,040
But that's okay.

372
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,240
To tell you the truth,

373
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:55,800
I don't need you to like me.

374
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,640
I came to the 1st Battalion this time

375
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:00,680
for only one reason.

376
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:03,360
It was an organizational arrangement.

377
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,200
I must obey.

378
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:07,520
But my feelings are the same as yours.

379
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,680
Reluctant.

380
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,640
Since we can't disobey the organization,

381
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,280
and I believe you don't have the power

382
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,680
to remove me as your battalion commander,

383
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,640
then starting today,

384
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:28,080
I hope everyone can temporarily put aside

385
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:30,040
your personal grudges against me.

386
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,520
And first, let's rid the 1st Battalion

387
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,800
of the Fake Battalion label.

388
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,120
Report!

389
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:38,600
Speak.

390
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,640
We are not a Fake Battalion.

391
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,000
We are a Red Army Battalion.

392
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,080
An ever-victorious battalion.

393
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,440
That is all!

394
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,400
That's right.

395
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,640
As for the 1st Battalion's Hall of Honor,

396
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,920
the Political Instructor just took me to see it.

397
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:52,600
But those honors

398
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,880
were created by your predecessors.

399
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,560
What do they have to do with you?

400
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:01,120
I've seen 1st Battalion's recent results.

401
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,800
In confrontations with the 2nd Battalion,

402
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:05,920
there is only one result.

403
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,160
Failure.

404
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:08,400
Failure.

405
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:09,760
And more failure.

406
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,920
The 1st Battalion's honors

407
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:20,160
were forged in blood by your predecessors.

408
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:21,960
Starting today,

409
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,880
in order to continue the 1st Battalion's legacy,

410
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,320
I hope

411
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:28,000
the successors of the Red 1st Battalion

412
00:16:28,640 --> 00:16:31,520
can use a real fight on the battlefield

413
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,920
to take back the 1st Battalion's honor.

414
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,160
And knock the 2nd Battalion

415
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,320
to the ground.

416
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,280
I think the Battalion Commander

417
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,120
is absolutely right.

418
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,360
Starting tomorrow night,

419
00:16:45,640 --> 00:16:47,600
we swear to fight the 2nd Battalion

420
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:50,120
for real.

421
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,720
How could we possibly beat 2nd Battalion?

422
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,320
At best, we just won't lose as badly.

423
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,360
Exactly.

424
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,160
What?

425
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,520
Being pussies?

426
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:04,319
Want to give up?

427
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,280
I was just in the Hall of Honor,

428
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:15,280
looking for one word.

429
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:17,240
But I couldn't find it.

430
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,720
Does anyone know

431
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:19,760
what word it is?

432
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:21,240
Pussy.

433
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,160
Right.

434
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,480
The predecessors of the Red 1st Battalion

435
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:26,319
never thought about

436
00:17:26,359 --> 00:17:27,640
or used this word.

437
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,800
Are the successors of the Red 1st Battalion

438
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,560
going to wear this word

439
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,760
and proudly stick it on their faces?

440
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:34,840
Can we?

441
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,040
No!

442
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,520
Absolutely not!

443
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:38,160
Good.

444
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,080
That's what I want to hear.

445
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,520
Starting today,

446
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:45,280
the 1st Battalion enters a combat-ready state.

447
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,840
Any personal grudges against me,

448
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,400
are an internal matter

449
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:50,920
within our 1st Battalion.

450
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,880
Once we win this battle,

451
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,640
I will put myself at your disposal.

452
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:58,800
If you're real men,

453
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,040
get moving!

454
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:01,480
Yes, sir!

455
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:02,880
Staff Officer Liang.

456
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,080
Big news!

457
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,600
The Combat After-Action Review Exercise is set.

458
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,760
The 1st Battalion has a new commander.

459
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:10,840
Want to know who it is?

460
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:13,920
Squad Leader Hong,

461
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:16,760
the base transferred you to me

462
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:18,120
to assist with my work,

463
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,640
not to spread gossip.

464
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,320
Also,

465
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:23,440
have you sorted out the exercise details?

466
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,320
Staff Officer Liang,

467
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:26,280
you can't just focus on work every day.

468
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:27,520
You're like a robot.

469
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,720
That's not good.

470
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:32,920
It's already done.

471
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:38,880
Let me tell you,

472
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,600
the new 396th Brigade battalion commander

473
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,320
is that Guo Zijian from the Infantry Academy.

474
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,400
Surprised?

475
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,360
Guo Zijian?

476
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:50,280
He's always been

477
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:53,080
a talent in military command research.

478
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:54,440
Going to the 1st Battalion as a commander,

479
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,760
why is that surprising?

480
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:56,600
No,

481
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:58,600
a few days ago,

482
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:00,040
wasn't he the one who tied you up?

483
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,360
He already apologized to me.

484
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,080
That's it?

485
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:04,880
What else?

486
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:06,760
Fine.

487
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,960
I'm just worrying about others' business.

488
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,440
However,

489
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:12,000
Guo Zijian won't have an easy time

490
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,320
in the 1st Battalion either.

491
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,200
Staff Officer Liang,

492
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,400
what kind of person is he?

493
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,880
Why do you care so much about him?

494
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,360
I've read his master's thesis.

495
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,240
His academic research is outstanding,

496
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,000
and his ideas are very advanced.

497
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,040
Combat skills?

498
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,440
His combat skills should be

499
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,240
at the level of a special forces operator.

500
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:39,640
Staff Officer Liang, I'm not asking about that.

501
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,080
Staff Officer Liang,

502
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:41,960
I mean,

503
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:43,920
his personality, his looks...

504
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,040
Is he handsome?

505
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:47,240
Personality?

506
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:49,400
He's arrogant and conceited,

507
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:50,720
and doesn't play by the rules.

508
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:52,720
But he's quite articulate.

509
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:54,040
Looks?

510
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:58,560
What do you consider handsome?

511
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:07,680
Hello, Commander.

512
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:08,960
This is Liang Hong.

513
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,920
Director Xu of the Group Army's Ops Branch

514
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:12,880
has arranged everything.

515
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,080
The detailed implementation plan is ready,

516
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:17,120
and the tasks will be deployed tonight.

517
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:21,040
Understood.

518
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:22,240
Please rest assured,

519
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,320
we guarantee to complete the mission.

520
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,080
Staff Liang.

521
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,040
Why does a minor confrontation

522
00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:32,440
get so much attention from Commander Ma?

523
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:35,880
Because for this minor confrontation,

524
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,240
leaders from the Infantry Academy will observe.

525
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,240
Leaders of the Group Army will be watching.

526
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:43,880
And all comrades of the 396th Brigade

527
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,120
will be spectating.

528
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:46,120
Tell me, is it important?

529
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,680
Blind confrontation,

530
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,000
pure free-play.

531
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,200
Not bad.

532
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:53,600
Interesting.

533
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:54,840
Dean Chen.

534
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:55,800
What do you think?

535
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,760
It's quite targeted.

536
00:20:58,520 --> 00:20:59,120
Good.

537
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:00,320
Director Xu.

538
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,720
It's quite an impressive plan.

539
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,000
I wouldn't dare say that.

540
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:04,880
Staff Liang designed this on her own.

541
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,880
I wouldn't dare take the credit.

542
00:21:07,080 --> 00:21:08,560
A brilliant student from a great teacher, then.

543
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,840
This design is indeed quite innovative.

544
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,920
I didn't expect that at such a young age,

545
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:18,080
her grasp of tactics and strategy

546
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:18,840
would be so deep.

547
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,840
If she heard you praising her like this,

548
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:21,960
she'd get a big head.

549
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,040
However, this is still

550
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,520
a long way from completing

551
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:26,480
her thesis.

552
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:29,080
But then again,

553
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,160
Guo Zijian...

554
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,960
if he had half of Liang Hong's discipline,

555
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:33,000
he wouldn't be...

556
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:34,680
Never mind, let's drop it.

557
00:21:35,360 --> 00:21:38,120
Shall we announce the subject as is?

558
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:39,880
What do you think?

559
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:40,560
Dean Chen?

560
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,000
I'll follow your lead.

561
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:42,840
I have no objections.

562
00:21:43,280 --> 00:21:43,800
Alright.

563
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,160
Announce it.

564
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:45,920
Yes, sir.

565
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:49,680
The 1st and 2nd Battalion confrontation is named:

566
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,440
Mountain Meeting Engagement of a

567
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:52,920
New-Type Company-Sized Battle Group.

568
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:54,560
Both opposing sides

569
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:57,280
will each deploy a baseline of 100 men

570
00:21:57,280 --> 00:21:58,720
in a company-sized detachment.

571
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:01,440
The combat rules remain unchanged.

572
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:02,840
Please note:

573
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,920
both sides must rely entirely on the

574
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:07,760
Combined Arms Battalion's current assets.

575
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:08,400
Alright.

576
00:22:09,520 --> 00:22:11,560
Staff Liang has already covered the basic rules.

577
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:12,840
Tomorrow at 20:00 hours,

578
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,480
both forces will begin mobilizing.

579
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:15,320
At exactly 22:00 hours,

580
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,640
the confrontation will officially begin.

581
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:17,560
Next,

582
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:18,880
I'll clarify

583
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,440
the confrontation area.

584
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:26,600
Jiang Shengqiang.

585
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:34,080
What?

586
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:36,360
The exercise hasn't even started yet.

587
00:22:37,040 --> 00:22:37,960
Are you getting ready to surrender?

588
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,200
Surrender?

589
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:40,880
Dream on!

590
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,360
We were classmates after all,

591
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:45,080
and comrades in the same unit.

592
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,720
Aren't you going to buy me a meal

593
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:47,640
to welcome me?

594
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,400
Are we friends?

595
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:54,600
No.

596
00:22:55,560 --> 00:22:56,720
Are we enemies?

597
00:22:57,800 --> 00:22:58,280
Yes.

598
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:00,440
Surely not.

599
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,640
Over a minor incident from years ago,

600
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:04,000
you're still holding a grudge?

601
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:05,640
You're way too petty.

602
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:07,920
I am just that petty.

603
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:09,960
Is this your first day knowing me?

604
00:23:12,600 --> 00:23:13,880
I just don't get it.

605
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,160
Do you even have friends here?

606
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:19,040
Why insist on coming to the 396th Brigade?

607
00:23:19,840 --> 00:23:20,480
What?

608
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:22,800
Trying to muddy the waters here?

609
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,680
Are you afraid I'll steal your thunder?

610
00:23:29,040 --> 00:23:30,520
Stealing the thunder

611
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:32,880
is an innate talent of yours, Guo Zijian.

612
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,120
I gladly concede defeat.

613
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:36,360
But in this confrontation,

614
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,760
you're bound to lose.

615
00:23:39,040 --> 00:23:39,960
Is that so?

616
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:42,240
Then we'll see about that.

617
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:45,760
Guo Zijian.

618
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:53,480
Don't think

619
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,680
winning with dirty tricks before

620
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,440
means you always will.

621
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:02,640
The 396th Brigade isn't your playground.

622
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,280
Someone like you

623
00:24:06,200 --> 00:24:07,600
only deserves to be with the 1st Battalion.

624
00:24:07,600 --> 00:24:09,160
A unit with that level of training

625
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,200
is exactly where you belong.

626
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:22,240
I don't care about 1st Battalion's past.

627
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,000
Starting today,

628
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:27,280
the 1st Battalion I lead

629
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:29,360
will be the 396th Brigade's

630
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:31,440
irreplaceable ace.

631
00:24:48,280 --> 00:24:49,080
Battalion Commander Guo,

632
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,000
this fighting style of yours,

633
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,640
I've truly never seen it before.

634
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,920
It's a total mess.

635
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:56,440
We can't fight like this.

636
00:24:59,840 --> 00:25:00,480
Dong Zhenguo!

637
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:01,440
Here!

638
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,080
Give it a try.

639
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:14,200
Battalion Commander Guo,

640
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:15,400
we know

641
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:17,160
you've been doing research at the academy,

642
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,000
so you must have a lot of schemes in mind.

643
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:20,520
But these tricks of yours,

644
00:25:20,520 --> 00:25:21,960
can you save them for later?

645
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:23,800
The battle starts tomorrow!

646
00:25:23,800 --> 00:25:25,560
Now you're breaking our classic tactics?

647
00:25:25,560 --> 00:25:26,880
This is ridiculous!

648
00:25:29,080 --> 00:25:29,640
Battalion Commander,

649
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:31,640
Comrade Li Songwei

650
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:32,880
is our 1st Battalion's

651
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,160
most capable company commander.

652
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,160
How about

653
00:25:35,320 --> 00:25:37,280
we let him take command for a bit?

654
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,760
Political Instructor,

655
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:41,200
I'd love to take command,

656
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:42,160
but look,

657
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:42,840
Battalion Commander Guo here

658
00:25:42,840 --> 00:25:44,720
has torn my 1st Company to pieces!

659
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:45,800
How am I supposed to fight this battle?

660
00:25:45,800 --> 00:25:47,000
You will fight

661
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:48,400
however you are told!

662
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,040
Yes, sir.

663
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:54,800
Ever since Guo Zijian took office,

664
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,840
1st Battalion has been full of complaints.

665
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:59,600
Many soldiers secretly try to trip him up.

666
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,160
Even though they're just minor pranks,

667
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:03,600
it's enough to prove

668
00:26:03,840 --> 00:26:04,560
that the 1st Battalion

669
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,400
has no respect for him.

670
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:10,080
He plays people for fools,

671
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,840
how could anyone respect him?

672
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,160
I'd like to see

673
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:17,400
how he turns 1st Battalion into an ace.

674
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:19,520
Just wait and see,

675
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:22,160
there'll be plenty more jokes to come.

676
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:23,840
Battalion Commander,

677
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:27,280
what kind of grudge do you

678
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,840
actually have with Guo Zijian?

679
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:31,720
That kid is full of schemes.

680
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:33,960
Back when we were in the same seminar,

681
00:26:34,640 --> 00:26:35,560
during the graduation

682
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:37,200
combat competition,

683
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:39,800
he played dirty with me.

684
00:26:41,040 --> 00:26:43,000
He incited one of my staff officers,

685
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:46,360
making me lose the chance at top cadet.

686
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:48,560
A position in the headquarters

687
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:51,280
slipped right past me.

688
00:26:53,520 --> 00:26:54,720
If Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

689
00:26:54,800 --> 00:26:56,360
hadn't transferred me to the 396th Brigade,

690
00:26:57,360 --> 00:26:58,360
I really wouldn't know

691
00:27:00,560 --> 00:27:02,120
where I, Jiang Shengqiang, would be now.

692
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:05,760
He stole the top cadet spot.

693
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,280
That's the most hateful part.

694
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,160
Before enrollment,

695
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:14,200
his position had just been adjusted.

696
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:17,960
He didn't even need the top cadet award.

697
00:27:18,560 --> 00:27:19,800
It was pure spite, with no gain for him.

698
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:22,120
Guo Zijian has terrible character.

699
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:23,800
We must teach him a lesson.

700
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,520
So in this confrontation,

701
00:27:29,080 --> 00:27:30,200
we absolutely have to win.

702
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:33,560
We must make him suffer a crushing defeat.

703
00:27:39,280 --> 00:27:39,960
Battalion Commander,

704
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:42,160
is this really going to work?

705
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:45,000
I know I'm not an expert in tactics,

706
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:46,280
but I also understand

707
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,920
the principle of concentrating forces.

708
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:50,640
Picking and choosing troops like this

709
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,040
is clearly

710
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:53,360
a major military taboo.

711
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,840
Speaking of military strategy,

712
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:57,200
which military strategist in history has ever said

713
00:27:57,360 --> 00:27:59,520
that a tactic can remain unchanged forever?

714
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:01,840
I understand what you're saying.

715
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:04,040
But time is just too short.

716
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:04,800
Political Instructor,

717
00:28:05,560 --> 00:28:07,160
it's exactly because time is too short

718
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:08,920
that I can't build teamwork with everyone.

719
00:28:09,160 --> 00:28:10,760
So I can only make them follow orders.

720
00:28:14,600 --> 00:28:15,680
In this confrontation,

721
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:17,120
the 1st Battalion's main force

722
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:18,360
will definitely be Li Songwei.

723
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:20,920
They'll also deploy support firepower.

724
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:22,680
Xu Dali!

725
00:28:23,080 --> 00:28:23,760
Here!

726
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:26,080
You and Li Songwei are old rivals,

727
00:28:26,760 --> 00:28:27,840
but in terms of strength,

728
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:29,840
you've always had the upper hand.

729
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:30,920
This time,

730
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:32,840
there won't be a problem, right?

731
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:33,720
No problem.

732
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:34,720
Taking down Li Songwei

733
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,640
will be a piece of cake.

734
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:36,920
Don't underestimate the enemy.

735
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:38,720
Staff Officer Zhou is right.

736
00:28:39,120 --> 00:28:40,600
We can't let our guard down.

737
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:41,880
Tactically,

738
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,960
we must keep a close eye on them

739
00:28:43,120 --> 00:28:44,640
and not give them a chance to breathe.

740
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,080
I guarantee I'll complete the mission!

741
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:46,880
Sit down.

742
00:28:48,320 --> 00:28:48,720
All right.

743
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,560
Now,

744
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:51,680
let's study the firepower deployment.

745
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,120
In the Peaks Mountain Area,

746
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,720
we'll set up a firepower point.

747
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,560
Report!

748
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,640
Commanders,

749
00:29:12,320 --> 00:29:13,840
The 100-man clash is about to begin.

750
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:17,720
Do you think this meeting engagement

751
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:20,440
will turn into a brutal bayonet clash?

752
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:21,920
I'd say it's entirely possible.

753
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:23,360
Certain major military powers,

754
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:25,000
haven't they always been pushing

755
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,560
steamroller-style tactics?

756
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:29,360
It all comes down to superior firepower.

757
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:31,640
If the battle turns out like that,

758
00:29:31,840 --> 00:29:33,040
there really won't be much to see.

759
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:33,800
Attention!

760
00:29:38,480 --> 00:29:39,040
Take your seats.

761
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:40,800
Be seated.

762
00:29:40,800 --> 00:29:42,160
Here, Dean Chen.

763
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:42,600
You first.

764
00:29:42,600 --> 00:29:43,520
You're the guest.

765
00:29:43,840 --> 00:29:44,280
Alright, alright.

766
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:45,360
After you, Commander.

767
00:29:48,640 --> 00:29:49,240
Look,

768
00:29:49,800 --> 00:29:51,760
although today is a small confrontation,

769
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,520
it will truly test their skills.

770
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,520
An infantry meeting engagement,

771
00:29:55,520 --> 00:29:56,800
with 100 men on each side.

772
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:57,960
I reckon

773
00:29:58,600 --> 00:29:59,840
two rounds of offense and defense should wrap it up.

774
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:01,160
That makes sense.

775
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:02,560
But not necessarily.

776
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:03,920
It all depends on

777
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:06,160
how the commander designs this battle.

778
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:07,640
Right, Dean Chen?

779
00:30:09,360 --> 00:30:10,360
What can I say?

780
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:12,520
Right now, Guo Zijian

781
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:13,880
is no longer my man.

782
00:30:18,600 --> 00:30:19,280
Report!

783
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:21,040
Our drones have spotted at the enemy position

784
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,080
heavy equipment entered the ambush zone.

785
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,480
Sure enough, they're using Li Songwei's company.

786
00:30:25,880 --> 00:30:26,360
However,

787
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:27,800
they are very cautious.

788
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:28,560
And very careful too.

789
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:31,000
Drones alone aren't enough.

790
00:30:31,600 --> 00:30:33,360
What have the ground recon teams found?

791
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:35,280
Ground recon hasn't reported back yet.

792
00:30:35,800 --> 00:30:36,480
Then we wait.

793
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,680
We'll move once the results come in.

794
00:30:40,520 --> 00:30:42,120
Have you spotted their scouts?

795
00:30:42,120 --> 00:30:43,000
Not yet.

796
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:46,280
Stay on guard.

797
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:47,000
Yes, sir!

798
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:04,840
Company Commander Li,

799
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:07,200
what exactly is the Commander up to?

800
00:31:07,520 --> 00:31:08,480
At this hour,

801
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,840
the troops haven't fully assembled yet.

802
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,600
We finally just entered the combat zone,

803
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:14,560
and we're immediately pulled out

804
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,360
to rush to Laofengkou at full speed.

805
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:18,360
Switching from assault to defense.

806
00:31:18,360 --> 00:31:19,280
Tell me about it.

807
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,600
I'm annoyed too.

808
00:31:21,800 --> 00:31:24,120
They said I'd be the main force,

809
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:25,760
but they only assigned me 40 men.

810
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:30,560
You don't even have 40 men here, do you?

811
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,640
I just received an order,

812
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,640
and half of them were taken away again.

813
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,920
How am I supposed to fight this battle?

814
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:35,280
Then why didn't you go?

815
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,720
Battalion Commander Guo said

816
00:31:38,600 --> 00:31:39,400
this spot

817
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:42,080
is the key to winning this confrontation.

818
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:43,680
He told me to hold the line.

819
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:46,840
What trick is the Commander pulling?

820
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:48,120
Looks like poison to me.

821
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,080
This student officer

822
00:31:51,080 --> 00:31:51,760
knows absolutely nothing

823
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,000
and gives blind orders.

824
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:01,480
Staff Officer Liang,

825
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:04,040
why is there no combat atmosphere at all?

826
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:08,560
They are waiting for the perfect moment.

827
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:11,240
Watch the links with Exercise Control.

828
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:11,960
And communications.

829
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:12,800
Yes, sir.

830
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:17,920
Report.

831
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:19,840
Ground recon personnel have completed reconnaissance.

832
00:32:19,920 --> 00:32:21,840
They match the drone's evening recon.

833
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:22,560
Good.

834
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:23,920
Order the artillery to open fire.

835
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,800
Destroy the enemy's main heavy equipment

836
00:32:26,360 --> 00:32:27,720
to clear the way for Xu Dali

837
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,400
to eliminate Li Songwei.

838
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:30,000
Yes, sir.

839
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:15,040
Squad leader, your Golden Right Foot lives up to its name.

840
00:33:15,840 --> 00:33:16,920
Cut the flattery.

841
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:17,720
You guys.

842
00:33:18,120 --> 00:33:19,280
You're eliminated, so behave yourselves.

843
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:25,360
What?

844
00:33:25,840 --> 00:33:27,040
You wanna break the rules?

845
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:28,600
Huzi, get to work.

846
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,560
Serve 'em.

847
00:33:39,560 --> 00:33:40,160
Hold still.

848
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:42,640
Open your mouth.

849
00:33:54,800 --> 00:33:55,520
It's started.

850
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:01,520
Hurry up, everyone.

851
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:02,560
Yes, sir!

852
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:08,000
Looks like they've engaged.

853
00:34:08,120 --> 00:34:10,080
That doesn't look like an engagement.

854
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:13,360
This is clearly 2nd Battalion unloading.

855
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:17,000
The strike results should be uploaded soon.

856
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:20,239
Jiang Shengqiang, I know him.

857
00:34:20,520 --> 00:34:22,199
He doesn't fight losing battles.

858
00:34:27,600 --> 00:34:29,199
I knew this was poison.

859
00:34:29,520 --> 00:34:30,560
So much for tactical proficiency.

860
00:34:31,040 --> 00:34:32,920
He's using 1st Company as cannon fodder.

861
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,000
Sir!

862
00:34:34,600 --> 00:34:36,360
Commander, the strike results are in.

863
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:38,800
1st Battalion took 15% casualties.

864
00:34:46,199 --> 00:34:48,159
All units, prepare to move.

865
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:49,000
Yes, sir!

866
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:51,520
Strike effective.

867
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:53,360
1st Company main force took heavy damage.

868
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:55,719
Tell Xu Dali to speed up the assault.

869
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:57,120
Wipe out Li Songwei's remaining forces.

870
00:34:57,120 --> 00:34:57,760
Yes, sir!

871
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:14,560
Sir!

872
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:16,440
Commander, there's barely anyone here.

873
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,920
You don't think they ran away, do you?

874
00:35:18,040 --> 00:35:18,680
Radioman!

875
00:35:18,680 --> 00:35:19,040
Here!

876
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:20,520
Turn on the comms.

877
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,440
Battalion Commander, Company Commander Xu is on the line.

878
00:35:27,160 --> 00:35:28,160
This is Jiang Shengqiang.

879
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:29,120
Battalion Commander,

880
00:35:29,520 --> 00:35:30,880
I've assaulted 1st Battalion's position,

881
00:35:31,200 --> 00:35:32,560
but apart from the IFV we just took out

882
00:35:32,560 --> 00:35:33,800
and some of their troops,

883
00:35:34,200 --> 00:35:35,320
there is no one else here.

884
00:35:35,600 --> 00:35:36,120
What?

885
00:35:42,960 --> 00:35:43,720
Beautiful!

886
00:35:45,040 --> 00:35:47,320
Didn't expect the kid to actually be this good.

887
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:47,720
Understood.

888
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,240
Spread out! Take cover!

889
00:35:49,640 --> 00:35:50,160
Take cover!

890
00:35:56,760 --> 00:35:57,400
Radioman!

891
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,160
Battalion Commander!

892
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:01,720
My company is under heavy fire!

893
00:36:02,640 --> 00:36:03,640
It's a trap!

894
00:36:03,680 --> 00:36:05,680
Sir, 1st Battalion's position is low.

895
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:06,960
We can't get our equipment out!

896
00:36:07,040 --> 00:36:07,840
Based on the terrain,

897
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,320
there's only one flat area to the north.

898
00:36:10,080 --> 00:36:10,880
Xu Dali!

899
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,120
Withdraw to the north side immediately!

900
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:29,560
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

901
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:31,280
To both our east and west,

902
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,680
we spotted 1st Battalion's assault guns

903
00:36:32,680 --> 00:36:34,000
and wheeled armored vehicles moving.

904
00:36:34,440 --> 00:36:35,400
What's the meaning of this?

905
00:36:36,720 --> 00:36:38,280
Guo Zijian wants to encircle us.

906
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:41,080
With the few men he has?

907
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,520
He's way too arrogant.

908
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:43,600
Radioman!

909
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:43,960
Yes, sir!

910
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:48,400
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

911
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:51,240
We hit multiple engineer IEDs on the move.

912
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,280
Combat losses are severe.

913
00:36:57,160 --> 00:36:57,720
Zhou Jiadong!

914
00:36:57,720 --> 00:36:58,200
Yes, sir!

915
00:36:58,440 --> 00:37:00,800
Order reserves to rendezvous with Xu Dali.

916
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:02,840
That will be the enemy's main attack area.

917
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:03,360
Yes, sir!

918
00:37:06,600 --> 00:37:08,080
If they keep fighting like this,

919
00:37:09,120 --> 00:37:10,960
the outcome will be decided very soon.

920
00:37:12,560 --> 00:37:14,320
A confrontation between two company-sized units...

921
00:37:14,640 --> 00:37:15,480
with so few people,

922
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:17,920
they won't last long once the firepower engages.

923
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,480
The way this battle is unfolding...

924
00:37:28,640 --> 00:37:30,760
is it getting harder and harder to read?

925
00:37:32,640 --> 00:37:34,360
Sometimes, the harder it is to read,

926
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:36,200
the more interesting it gets later on.

927
00:37:36,520 --> 00:37:36,960
Indeed, sir.

928
00:37:45,040 --> 00:37:46,640
Why haven't we received the order to attack?

929
00:37:47,240 --> 00:37:48,080
Is communication down?

930
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:49,560
Reporting, Company Commander. Comms are clear,

931
00:37:49,560 --> 00:37:50,200
but there are no orders.

932
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:55,120
Is the recon squad in position?

933
00:37:55,200 --> 00:37:56,400
Reporting. In position.

934
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:57,400
They are locating the target.

935
00:38:01,200 --> 00:38:02,160
What's the situation now?

936
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:04,200
The enemy is launching massed fire strikes.

937
00:38:04,400 --> 00:38:06,200
Their equipment and troops are everywhere.

938
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:08,560
That's not company-level firepower.

939
00:38:11,680 --> 00:38:13,280
You've got some nerve, Guo Zijian.

940
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,520
You dare break the rules?

941
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,160
What should we do?

942
00:38:18,600 --> 00:38:20,440
What level of combat power does 1st Battalion have?

943
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,320
It's plain for all to see.

944
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,120
Even if Guo Zijian is breaking the rules,

945
00:38:23,120 --> 00:38:24,320
it won't be that easy for him to win.

946
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:28,240
Order Xu Dali to look for a chance to break out.

947
00:38:28,240 --> 00:38:28,720
Yes, sir.

948
00:38:31,040 --> 00:38:33,640
4th Company, 4th Company! Find a chance to break out.

949
00:38:33,720 --> 00:38:35,160
Find a chance to break out.

950
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:40,480
Found it!

951
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:43,320
Target: 2nd Battalion's command post.

952
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:43,960
Huzi!

953
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:44,960
Send the coordinates!

954
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:45,280
Copy that!

955
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:46,280
Call in artillery strikes!

956
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:50,520
Squad Leader!

957
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:52,520
We're about to win, right?

958
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,000
Good.

959
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:56,480
Prepare artillery fire!

960
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:57,040
Yes, sir!

961
00:38:58,760 --> 00:38:59,400
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

962
00:38:59,520 --> 00:39:01,720
Our assault gun position was ambushed by enemy recon.

963
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:04,240
Their team destroyed all three guns.

964
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,520
We can't provide suppressive fire.

965
00:39:05,720 --> 00:39:07,760
Have the engineer platoon send a demo team,

966
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:08,760
and a fire support team.

967
00:39:08,760 --> 00:39:10,520
Rendezvous with Wu Dongsheng's team now.

968
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:11,240
Yes, sir!

969
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:13,200
Li Songwei still has some troops left.

970
00:39:13,200 --> 00:39:13,960
Should we use them first?

971
00:39:14,160 --> 00:39:16,320
Once Jiang Shengqiang spots my intentions,

972
00:39:16,560 --> 00:39:18,200
he'll make adjustments immediately.

973
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:20,240
With a group of just over a hundred men,

974
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:22,000
their formation can change very quickly.

975
00:39:22,480 --> 00:39:24,480
We must save Li Songwei for the key moment

976
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:25,240
before we use him.

977
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:29,000
Something's wrong, Squad Leader.

978
00:39:30,040 --> 00:39:30,960
No response.

979
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,520
Did it fail to send?

980
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:35,760
It shouldn't have, Squad Leader.

981
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:40,200
Huzi!

982
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,880
Find a way to draw their attention,

983
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,920
and cover me as I sneak into their CP.

984
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:45,720
Yes!

985
00:39:52,560 --> 00:39:53,400
Okay, I understand.

986
00:39:54,560 --> 00:39:55,560
Battalion Commander, good news!

987
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:57,760
Our recon unit covered the assault fire,

988
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:58,960
and wiped out their heavy firepower.

989
00:39:59,160 --> 00:39:59,960
Well done.

990
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:01,320
Reporting!

991
00:40:01,640 --> 00:40:02,200
Come in.

992
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:05,760
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

993
00:40:06,240 --> 00:40:07,840
There's enemy recon activity in our rear.

994
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,400
Didn't we set up sentries?

995
00:40:09,720 --> 00:40:10,680
Why wasn't there any news?

996
00:40:11,080 --> 00:40:11,960
They might have been taken out.

997
00:40:13,040 --> 00:40:14,840
We can't let them locate our command post.

998
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:16,760
Send men to eliminate them immediately.

999
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:17,360
Yes, sir.

1000
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:23,840
Staff Officer Liang.

1001
00:40:24,240 --> 00:40:24,640
Here!

1002
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,720
Execute Plan B.

1003
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:27,400
Yes, sir.

1004
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:33,600
Report!

1005
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:34,440
Come in.

1006
00:40:38,600 --> 00:40:39,360
Battalion Commander Guo.

1007
00:40:39,360 --> 00:40:40,120
Political Instructor Sang.

1008
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:41,480
Notice from Exercise Control:

1009
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:43,400
The battalion command post was destroyed.

1010
00:40:43,520 --> 00:40:44,960
All command post functions are deactivated.

1011
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:47,000
Please assemble at the command center now.

1012
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:50,560
Commander Jiang, from Exercise Control:

1013
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:52,680
Your battalion command post has been destroyed.

1014
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:54,040
All command post functions are deactivated.

1015
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,880
Please report to the command center now.

1016
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:08,200
Squad Leader Wu,

1017
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:09,320
impressive.

1018
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:11,320
You sneaked all the way into my command post.

1019
00:41:12,080 --> 00:41:12,640
Battalion Commander Jiang,

1020
00:41:13,520 --> 00:41:14,160
my apologies.

1021
00:41:16,560 --> 00:41:17,360
Let me tell you,

1022
00:41:18,800 --> 00:41:20,240
your win doesn't count.

1023
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:26,880
What's going on?

1024
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,600
We just got here and we already won?

1025
00:41:30,040 --> 00:41:30,760
Report!

1026
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:31,520
Speak.

1027
00:41:32,480 --> 00:41:34,480
Chief, what exactly is going on?

1028
00:41:35,040 --> 00:41:36,200
Who actually won?

1029
00:41:38,040 --> 00:41:39,680
Now is not the time to discuss winning or losing.

1030
00:41:40,320 --> 00:41:43,640
Look at how lively this battle is getting.

1031
00:41:51,680 --> 00:41:52,360
Chiefs,

1032
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:53,920
I'd also like to ask,

1033
00:41:54,240 --> 00:41:54,960
without command,

1034
00:41:55,560 --> 00:41:56,920
won't this turn into a complete mess?

1035
00:41:59,640 --> 00:42:01,120
Right now, we want to see

1036
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:03,680
after decapitation of the command post,

1037
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:05,840
how exactly the troops will fight.

1038
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:24,560
Commander, we lost contact with battalion.

1039
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:25,720
Probably electromagnetic interference.

1040
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:26,600
Try again in a bit.

1041
00:42:26,600 --> 00:42:27,040
Copy that.

1042
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:29,960
Second Platoon Leader,

1043
00:42:30,720 --> 00:42:32,080
no matter what happens on my end,

1044
00:42:32,520 --> 00:42:33,520
don't move a single soldier.

1045
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:34,880
Don't release the hawk until you see the rabbit.

1046
00:42:36,440 --> 00:42:37,280
Attention, everyone.

1047
00:42:37,840 --> 00:42:38,640
Keep up with my pace.

1048
00:42:38,640 --> 00:42:39,560
Break out to the southwest!

1049
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:40,200
Move!

1050
00:42:49,240 --> 00:42:51,560
Attention, everyone. Get ready.
